    "flow_niqqMc": {
      "type": "flow",
      "blocks": {
        "media_k8GQ3M": {
          "type": "media",
          "settings": {
            "video": "shopify://files/videos/Amazon video_98a02cdd-aff5-408d-b624-135ad3a78762.mp4",
            "show_sound_control": false,
            "video_url": "",
            "video_alt_text": "",
            "enable_video_autoplay": true,
            "subheading": "",
            "heading": "Back Pain",
            "image_heading": "shopify://shop_images/back_pain_icon_c912bfa0-7aa4-4320-a30c-99044ddf543b.svg",
            "image_style_heading": "rounded",
            "image_ratio_heading": "aspect-square",
            "description": "<p>Back tightness often shows up when hips, hamstrings, and glutes get stiff or weak. Dan Castle went from level 10 pain in his lower back FOR TWO DECADES to being pain free after CastleFlexxing daily for 10-20 minutes (with mri results to prove it). CastleFlexx helps you stretch the entire posterior chain using active and passive stretching so you can build strength and flexibility at the same time.</p>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "open_new_window_button": false,
            "show_button_style": "primary"
          }
        },
        "media_QtHrx6": {
          "type": "media",
          "settings": {
            "video": "shopify://files/videos/Amazon video_98a02cdd-aff5-408d-b624-135ad3a78762.mp4",
            "show_sound_control": false,
            "video_url": "",
            "video_alt_text": "",
            "enable_video_autoplay": true,
            "subheading": "",
            "heading": "Hip Pain",
            "image_heading": "shopify://shop_images/hip_pain_icon_d3900275-b010-48c7-a130-56406c43aef2.svg",
            "image_style_heading": "rounded",
            "image_ratio_heading": "aspect-square",
            "description": "<p>Sitting can leave hip flexors and tissue feeling shortened and stuck. CastleFlexx gives you a stable way to work hip flexors, hamstrings, and glutes without cranking on your back or hands, making it easier to stay consistent and feel looser again.</p>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "open_new_window_button": false,
            "show_button_style": "primary"
          }
        },
        "media_jXeEUk": {
          "type": "media",
          "settings": {
            "video": "shopify://files/videos/Amazon video_98a02cdd-aff5-408d-b624-135ad3a78762.mp4",
            "show_sound_control": false,
            "video_url": "",
            "video_alt_text": "",
            "enable_video_autoplay": true,
            "subheading": "",
            "heading": "Plantar Fasciitis",
            "image_heading": "shopify://shop_images/plantar_fasciitis_icon_2.svg",
            "image_style_heading": "rounded",
            "image_ratio_heading": "aspect-square",
            "description": "<p>Some CastleFlexx users reported online that this device fixed their PF in days to weeks. While results will vary, CastleFlexx's foot hammock lets you pull into a controlled dorsiflexion and toe-extension stretch comfortably, without awkward straps or slipping, building flexibility and resilience with short, consistent sessions. Strengthening that tight band under your foot can make all the difference.</p>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "open_new_window_button": false,
            "show_button_style": "primary"
          }
        },
        "media_jGQUVT": {
          "type": "media",
          "settings": {
            "video": "shopify://files/videos/Amazon video_98a02cdd-aff5-408d-b624-135ad3a78762.mp4",
            "show_sound_control": false,
            "video_url": "",
            "video_alt_text": "",
            "enable_video_autoplay": true,
            "subheading": "",
            "heading": "Shoulder Pain",
            "image_heading": "shopify://shop_images/shoulder_pain.svg",
            "image_style_heading": "rounded",
            "image_ratio_heading": "aspect-square",
            "description": "<p>CastleFlexx helps open the chest and train shoulder mobility with controlled tension, so reaching overhead and moving through workouts feels more comfortable. Place your elbow into the hammock design. Subscribe to CastleFIT classes to learn upper body recovery and pain relief routines.</p>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "open_new_window_button": false,
            "show_button_style": "primary"
          }
        },
        "media_yg3pNw": {
          "type": "media",
          "settings": {
            "video": "shopify://files/videos/Amazon video_98a02cdd-aff5-408d-b624-135ad3a78762.mp4",
            "show_sound_control": false,
            "video_url": "",
            "video_alt_text": "",
            "enable_video_autoplay": true,
            "subheading": "",
            "heading": "High Blood Pressure",
            "image_heading": "shopify://shop_images/high_blood_pressure_icon_2b1c3c95-2208-4dc9-a3af-5676d97dcd4f.svg",
            "image_style_heading": "rounded",
            "image_ratio_heading": "aspect-square",
            "description": "<p>Stretching has been proven to lower blood pressure more effectively that brisk walking according to recent Europe studies published in 2022. A CastleFlexx session pairs well with slow breathing and a nightly wind-down routine, while you follow your clinician's plan daily.</p>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "open_new_window_button": false,
            "show_button_style": "primary"
          }
        },
        "media_8cJiTY": {
          "type": "media",
          "settings": {
            "video": "shopify://files/videos/Amazon video_98a02cdd-aff5-408d-b624-135ad3a78762.mp4",
            "show_sound_control": false,
            "video_url": "",
            "video_alt_text": "",
            "enable_video_autoplay": true,
            "subheading": "",
            "heading": "Knee Pain",
            "image_heading": "shopify://shop_images/back_pain_icon_c912bfa0-7aa4-4320-a30c-99044ddf543b.svg",
            "image_style_heading": "rounded",
            "image_ratio_heading": "aspect-square",
            "description": "<p>Knees don't work in isolation: ankles, calves, quads, hamstrings, and hips all influence how the joint tracks and loads. CastleFlexx lets you improve lower-body flexibility with steady, repeatable tension, helping you address tightness above and below the knee where movement issues often start. Great for runners, lifters, and long desk days. If pain is sharp or persistent, get it checked. Need HEAT for your knee? Check out the Heat Edition.</p>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "open_new_window_button": false,
            "show_button_style": "primary"
          }
        },
        "media_q7KreN": {
          "type": "media",
          "settings": {
            "video": "shopify://files/videos/Amazon video_98a02cdd-aff5-408d-b624-135ad3a78762.mp4",
            "show_sound_control": false,
            "video_url": "",
            "video_alt_text": "",
            "enable_video_autoplay": true,
            "subheading": "",
            "heading": "Tight Calves",
            "image_heading": "shopify://shop_images/tight_calves_icon_3140a72a-51de-459a-b5e3-8bdbb31bc405.svg",
            "image_style_heading": "rounded",
            "image_ratio_heading": "aspect-square",
            "description": "<p>You must treat your calves as part of the posterior chain, a calf stepper wont work because our muscles all connect and shouldn’t be treated in isolation in Dan Castle’s opinion. CastleFlexx elongates the muscles and tendons around, above and below the calf- that’s why so many consider it the best calf stretch they’ve ever experienced.</p>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "open_new_window_button": false,
            "show_button_style": "primary"
          }
        },
        "media_L99hUf": {
          "type": "media",
          "settings": {
            "video": "shopify://files/videos/Amazon video_98a02cdd-aff5-408d-b624-135ad3a78762.mp4",
            "show_sound_control": false,
            "video_url": "",
            "video_alt_text": "",
            "enable_video_autoplay": true,
            "subheading": "",
            "heading": "Circulation Issues",
            "image_heading": "shopify://shop_images/circulation_issues_icon_73477759-d689-4a22-aa85-39ec08bc21c9.svg",
            "image_style_heading": "rounded",
            "image_ratio_heading": "aspect-square",
            "description": "<p>Long periods of sitting can make legs feel heavy and stiff. Gentle stretching and movement can help you feel mobile and refreshed. CastleFlexx makes it easy to work calves, hamstrings, and hips in a seated position, so your body feels better after long days.</p>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "open_new_window_button": false,
            "show_button_style": "primary"
          }
        },
        "media_bhbTLx": {
          "type": "media",
          "settings": {
            "video": "shopify://files/videos/Amazon video_98a02cdd-aff5-408d-b624-135ad3a78762.mp4",
            "show_sound_control": false,
            "video_url": "",
            "video_alt_text": "",
            "enable_video_autoplay": true,
            "subheading": "",
            "heading": "Tennis Elbow",
            "image_heading": "shopify://shop_images/tennis_elbow_icon_7d7277a7-f138-4873-89d1-7972d76f2f07.svg",
            "image_style_heading": "rounded",
            "image_ratio_heading": "aspect-square",
            "description": "<p>Elbow flare-ups are often tied to overloaded forearms and gripping, not just the spot that hurts. CastleFlexx ( insert elbow into hammock) helps you lengthen the forearm-wrist chain and open the shoulders with less strain on your grip, so your body feels looser overall.</p>",
